1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 18=

3
00:00:13,798 --> 00:00:17,529
(Prosperity)

4
00:00:17,529 --> 00:00:18,529
Du Qiang's men.

5
00:00:19,488 --> 00:00:21,009
You've been through a lot lately.

6
00:00:24,728 --> 00:00:25,728
Tell them to get lost.

7
00:00:26,689 --> 00:00:28,169
Mr. Nie himself hired us.

8
00:00:28,489 --> 00:00:29,768
Who are you to kick us out?

9
00:00:34,448 --> 00:00:35,448
Get lost!

10
00:00:37,214 --> 00:00:38,214
Let's go.

11
00:00:43,969 --> 00:00:44,969
Let's go.

12
00:00:50,776 --> 00:00:52,550
- Jiasheng?
- J-Jiasheng?

13
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:53,550
Jiasheng is back.

14
00:00:54,218 --> 00:00:55,848
- Jiasheng.
- Jiasheng.

15
00:00:56,141 --> 00:00:57,141
Jiasheng.

16
00:00:57,873 --> 00:00:58,929
It's good to have you back.

17
00:01:04,488 --> 00:01:05,488
Tear it all down.

18
00:01:06,369 --> 00:01:07,369
Okay.

19
00:01:20,274 --> 00:01:21,274
Toss them!

20
00:01:22,648 --> 00:01:23,648
Jiasheng,

21
00:01:24,128 --> 00:01:25,128
there's another place

22
00:01:25,449 --> 00:01:27,729
that I think you should
see for yourself.

23
00:01:32,488 --> 00:01:33,529
These women were

24
00:01:33,529 --> 00:01:35,049
all swindled here by Du Qiang

25
00:01:35,049 --> 00:01:36,329
from all over the country.

26
00:01:36,568 --> 00:01:38,329
Bai Ruxue has kept them locked up here

27
00:01:38,449 --> 00:01:40,089
for secret training.

28
00:01:40,809 --> 00:01:41,928
Let them go immediately.

29
00:01:43,329 --> 00:01:44,689
Girls, follow me.

30
00:01:44,928 --> 00:01:45,928
Come down.

31
00:01:46,368 --> 00:01:47,368
- Come on.
- Nobody move!

32
00:01:56,089 --> 00:01:57,089
Jiasheng,

33
00:01:57,529 --> 00:01:59,568
making such a scene
the minute you're back?

34
00:02:00,368 --> 00:02:01,368
Did you forget

35
00:02:01,729 --> 00:02:03,848
that I'm still Prosperity's
major shareholder?

36
00:02:03,969 --> 00:02:04,969
Feng,

37
00:02:05,609 --> 00:02:06,889
some things are eyesores,

38
00:02:07,368 --> 00:02:08,368
so I replace them.

39
00:02:08,928 --> 00:02:09,928
You don't mind, do you?

40
00:02:12,128 --> 00:02:14,889
Those are just cheap little trinkets.

41
00:02:15,128 --> 00:02:17,368
They're nothing. Do as you like.

42
00:02:17,808 --> 00:02:19,609
But you can't touch them.

43
00:02:20,688 --> 00:02:23,009
I went through
a lot of trouble to get them.

44
00:02:23,688 --> 00:02:25,009
I'm going to send them all

45
00:02:25,009 --> 00:02:27,528
to the districts across Tianbei.

46
00:02:28,193 --> 00:02:29,193
I'm not going.

47
00:02:29,454 --> 00:02:30,801
- I'm not going.
- I'm not going.

48
00:02:30,928 --> 00:02:31,928
Shut up!

49
00:02:40,528 --> 00:02:41,528
You know how it is.

50
00:02:42,088 --> 00:02:44,968
I need to stay on good terms
with those officials.

51
00:02:45,488 --> 00:02:48,169
This is crucial for my votes.

52
00:02:48,449 --> 00:02:49,449
Take them away.

53
00:02:49,648 --> 00:02:50,648
Don't touch them!

54
00:02:58,928 --> 00:02:59,928
Feng,

55
00:03:00,729 --> 00:03:02,569
how about this? Don't trouble yourself.

56
00:03:02,569 --> 00:03:04,729
Leave the girls here. I'll watch them

57
00:03:05,009 --> 00:03:06,169
and get them trained.

58
00:03:06,208 --> 00:03:07,208
Smart man.

59
00:03:07,248 --> 00:03:08,569
If one goes missing later,

60
00:03:09,009 --> 00:03:10,248
you'll answer for it.

61
00:03:11,849 --> 00:03:12,849
Now, Jiasheng.

62
00:03:13,729 --> 00:03:16,569
Since Prosperity is back in your hands,

63
00:03:17,248 --> 00:03:19,968
when will I get Old Ghost's stuff?

64
00:03:27,169 --> 00:03:28,169
Feng,

65
00:03:29,569 --> 00:03:31,729
you should focus on your campaign first.

66
00:03:32,449 --> 00:03:34,928
I heard Tang Niansen's approval
has been climbing lately.

67
00:03:35,928 --> 00:03:36,928
Don't worry

68
00:03:36,968 --> 00:03:38,009
about petty things.

69
00:03:38,648 --> 00:03:39,968
Focus on the bigger picture.

70
00:03:45,289 --> 00:03:46,289
Don't worry, Feng.

71
00:03:46,609 --> 00:03:47,609
Leave it to me.

72
00:03:47,849 --> 00:03:49,129
I'll rein him in.

73
00:03:59,208 --> 00:04:01,208
Tu Jiasheng,
you heard Nie Feng just now.

74
00:04:01,368 --> 00:04:03,289
He's sending them
to Tianbei to make deals.

75
00:04:03,488 --> 00:04:04,808
Why didn't you let them go?

76
00:04:06,409 --> 00:04:08,009
It's not time to fall out yet.

77
00:04:08,289 --> 00:04:09,928
If we let them go without a proper plan,

78
00:04:10,409 --> 00:04:12,208
Nie Feng can drag them
right back anytime.

79
00:04:12,808 --> 00:04:14,329
They're safer staying at Prosperity.

80
00:04:14,729 --> 00:04:16,368
Yunian, I need your help.

81
00:04:16,528 --> 00:04:17,729
Take good care of them.

82
00:04:17,729 --> 00:04:19,609
For food, clothes, and shelter,

83
00:04:20,049 --> 00:04:21,449
follow Prosperity's old rules.

84
00:04:21,569 --> 00:04:23,449
Don't worry. I'll see to it.

85
00:04:50,209 --> 00:04:51,568
This office is yours,

86
00:04:52,328 --> 00:04:53,729
and so is Prosperity's security.

87
00:04:55,248 --> 00:04:56,248
Okay.

88
00:04:56,649 --> 00:04:57,649
By the way,

89
00:04:57,769 --> 00:04:59,169
you said it's not time yet.

90
00:05:00,089 --> 00:05:01,169
When will that be?

91
00:05:01,289 --> 00:05:02,568
When Nie Feng thinks

92
00:05:03,488 --> 00:05:05,209
he has everything under control.

93
00:05:13,928 --> 00:05:15,688
Jiasheng, we're back.

94
00:05:17,409 --> 00:05:18,409
Captain Xia.

95
00:05:19,008 --> 00:05:20,049
How's the prison?

96
00:05:20,289 --> 00:05:21,888
Sea Breeze got a new warden.

97
00:05:21,888 --> 00:05:23,688
The villa area is fully locked down.

98
00:05:24,928 --> 00:05:27,448
I only sent in my tip-off recently.

99
00:05:28,169 --> 00:05:29,248
How could it be so fast?

100
00:05:30,609 --> 00:05:31,649
You two take a rest.

101
00:05:37,409 --> 00:05:38,448
Come with me to a place.

102
00:05:45,529 --> 00:05:46,529
After you.

103
00:05:56,289 --> 00:05:57,568
Why did you bring me here?

104
00:06:07,089 --> 00:06:09,248
Lu kept the most important stuff
in Prosperity safe.

105
00:06:12,008 --> 00:06:13,368
No wonder people are saying

106
00:06:13,649 --> 00:06:14,769
Prosperity

107
00:06:15,409 --> 00:06:17,368
is the Celestial Duchy's
secret Personnel Bureau.

108
00:06:18,049 --> 00:06:20,089
All official promotions and appointments

109
00:06:20,289 --> 00:06:21,849
are decided by Prosperity.

110
00:06:22,209 --> 00:06:23,368
And this is why.

111
00:06:27,710 --> 00:06:29,256
(Xu Zhenbang,
Central Inspection Ministry)

112
00:06:36,008 --> 00:06:38,289
- Director Xu?
- Xu Zhenbang of the Central Inspection Ministry.

113
00:06:39,729 --> 00:06:41,089
He's a VIP of Prosperity.

114
00:06:50,336 --> 00:06:51,586
(Expense List)

115
00:06:52,049 --> 00:06:53,049
So,

116
00:06:53,089 --> 00:06:54,368
you had Director Xu

117
00:06:54,368 --> 00:06:55,808
arrest Tang Zhen directly?

118
00:06:56,688 --> 00:06:57,969
I just made a phone call,

119
00:06:58,209 --> 00:06:59,448
reminding him to speed up.

120
00:07:00,488 --> 00:07:02,169
Then Sea Breeze's new warden...

121
00:07:02,488 --> 00:07:03,488
I arranged that.

122
00:07:05,049 --> 00:07:07,089
You snatched Sea Breeze
from Nie Feng's hands?

123
00:07:08,529 --> 00:07:09,529
Not exactly "snatched".

124
00:07:10,128 --> 00:07:11,368
I just went with the flow.

125
00:07:11,529 --> 00:07:12,529
Besides,

126
00:07:12,649 --> 00:07:14,248
without your solid evidence,

127
00:07:14,529 --> 00:07:15,529
I couldn't have done it.

128
00:07:20,289 --> 00:07:21,289
The game you're playing

129
00:07:21,969 --> 00:07:23,688
is far bigger than I imagined.

130
00:07:24,488 --> 00:07:25,649
And the Celestial Duchy

131
00:07:26,169 --> 00:07:27,328
is far darker

132
00:07:27,328 --> 00:07:28,368
than I imagined.

133
00:07:28,888 --> 00:07:30,289
What's wrong with you people?

134
00:07:30,289 --> 00:07:31,808
This place is getting so boring.

135
00:07:31,888 --> 00:07:33,568
What on earth are you doing?

136
00:07:33,649 --> 00:07:35,888
You just tore down
the showcase area like that.

137
00:07:36,488 --> 00:07:37,888
Now we can't even pick the girls.

138
00:07:38,128 --> 00:07:39,488
And you girls too.

139
00:07:39,568 --> 00:07:41,529
You used to do whatever you were told.

140
00:07:41,529 --> 00:07:43,568
Now you throw a fit over a few words.

141
00:07:43,752 --> 00:07:45,120
- My apologies.
- Quit staring.

142
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:47,018
- Look, Jiasheng is here.
- Jiasheng.

143
00:07:47,161 --> 00:07:48,161
Let's go.

144
00:07:49,049 --> 00:07:50,049
Jiasheng.

145
00:07:51,488 --> 00:07:52,488
Jiasheng.

146
00:07:52,729 --> 00:07:53,729
You're back.

147
00:07:54,049 --> 00:07:55,169
Congratulations.

148
00:07:55,808 --> 00:07:57,808
But Prosperity keeps
changing back and forth.

149
00:07:57,808 --> 00:07:59,368
What's that about?

150
00:07:59,568 --> 00:08:01,448
All those special services are gone.

151
00:08:02,049 --> 00:08:03,448
How do we have fun now?

152
00:08:06,649 --> 00:08:07,649
Mr. Hao,

153
00:08:08,008 --> 00:08:09,969
you really enjoy
special services, don't you?

154
00:08:10,688 --> 00:08:11,888
We're all men here.

155
00:08:12,808 --> 00:08:14,049
Who doesn't?

156
00:08:16,209 --> 00:08:19,448
- Fine.
- Mr. Hao, let's go to a VIP room.

157
00:08:19,448 --> 00:08:20,688
I'll arrange it for you.

158
00:08:23,928 --> 00:08:24,928
Thank you, Jiasheng.

159
00:08:25,609 --> 00:08:26,888
Since you got out of jail,

160
00:08:26,888 --> 00:08:28,328
your temper has gotten much better.

161
00:08:28,328 --> 00:08:30,328
Been like this sooner,
you'd be rich by now.

162
00:08:30,328 --> 00:08:32,209
Anyway, I'll head in first.

163
00:08:32,529 --> 00:08:33,609
This way, please.

164
00:08:48,529 --> 00:08:49,529
Why scream?

165
00:08:57,889 --> 00:08:59,009
Want to talk?

166
00:08:59,928 --> 00:09:01,009
I'll grant your wish.

167
00:09:05,169 --> 00:09:06,169
Mr. Hao,

168
00:09:07,009 --> 00:09:09,208
are you satisfied with today's service?

169
00:09:09,448 --> 00:09:12,129
Yes, I'm satisfied! No more, please!

170
00:09:12,129 --> 00:09:13,448
Don't say that.

171
00:09:13,928 --> 00:09:15,848
So many darlings are waiting for you.

172
00:09:18,088 --> 00:09:19,169
Do you like this one?

173
00:09:20,889 --> 00:09:22,208
This one's not for you.

174
00:09:23,409 --> 00:09:24,848
Let me pick one for you.

175
00:09:26,369 --> 00:09:27,808
This one suits you nicely.

176
00:09:28,369 --> 00:09:30,608
No, I don't want it! I'm done!

177
00:09:30,649 --> 00:09:31,728
I was wrong.

178
00:09:31,728 --> 00:09:33,489
I-I'll follow the rules next time.

179
00:09:33,489 --> 00:09:35,848
- Next time?
- No! No next time!

180
00:09:35,848 --> 00:09:38,208
I-I'll never come back.

181
00:09:39,979 --> 00:09:41,515
Please spare me.

182
00:09:48,625 --> 00:09:49,736
I'll never do it again.

183
00:09:57,889 --> 00:09:59,448
Tu Jiasheng is back.

184
00:09:59,769 --> 00:10:01,848
Prosperity is reinstating its old rules.

185
00:10:02,169 --> 00:10:03,169
From now on,

186
00:10:03,208 --> 00:10:04,649
guests like this are not welcome.

187
00:10:05,728 --> 00:10:06,728
Get lost.

188
00:10:07,702 --> 00:10:08,995
- Exactly.
- He had quite a wild time.

189
00:10:09,009 --> 00:10:10,009
Nice!

190
00:10:12,928 --> 00:10:14,568
Music returns to the courtyard,

191
00:10:14,568 --> 00:10:16,568
and lantern light drifts
from the towers.

192
00:10:19,088 --> 00:10:21,448
This is how Prosperity should be.

193
00:10:21,889 --> 00:10:24,808
Before this, I was embarrassed
to even show my face here.

194
00:10:25,009 --> 00:10:26,808
Mr. Tang, this way, please.

195
00:10:33,009 --> 00:10:34,009
Mr. Tu,

196
00:10:34,289 --> 00:10:35,289
about the state dinner,

197
00:10:35,289 --> 00:10:36,289
I've been wanting

198
00:10:36,409 --> 00:10:37,409
to thank you in person.

199
00:10:37,529 --> 00:10:38,529
Without you stepping in,

200
00:10:38,529 --> 00:10:40,489
the Dongdao delegation would've

201
00:10:40,769 --> 00:10:42,009
stormed off in anger.

202
00:10:43,009 --> 00:10:44,649
Let alone the upcoming

203
00:10:44,649 --> 00:10:45,848
tripartite cooperation.

204
00:10:46,129 --> 00:10:47,129
It was nothing.

205
00:10:47,129 --> 00:10:48,129
You flatter me.

206
00:10:48,808 --> 00:10:50,289
If you didn't have the resources,

207
00:10:50,489 --> 00:10:52,049
I couldn't have built that bridge.

208
00:10:54,808 --> 00:10:57,009
A gentleman keeps his talents hidden,

209
00:10:57,409 --> 00:10:58,808
biding his time to strike.

210
00:10:59,328 --> 00:11:00,848
You help others get what they want

211
00:11:01,728 --> 00:11:03,409
without taking credit.

212
00:11:03,968 --> 00:11:04,968
You truly are

213
00:11:05,889 --> 00:11:07,208
a man of noble character.

214
00:11:11,568 --> 00:11:12,568
Mr. Tu,

215
00:11:13,409 --> 00:11:15,889
the tripartite cooperation framework
is basically agreed.

216
00:11:15,889 --> 00:11:17,009
Dongdao

217
00:11:17,289 --> 00:11:19,688
will soon send
an inspection team to Tianbei

218
00:11:19,808 --> 00:11:20,808
to check out

219
00:11:21,009 --> 00:11:22,009
the port

220
00:11:22,009 --> 00:11:24,649
and the cold-chain project sites.

221
00:11:24,808 --> 00:11:26,249
For the cooperation to succeed,

222
00:11:26,489 --> 00:11:27,848
the key isn't the project

223
00:11:28,289 --> 00:11:29,448
or the investment.

224
00:11:31,208 --> 00:11:32,568
What do you mean?

225
00:11:32,568 --> 00:11:33,688
The biggest variable

226
00:11:33,728 --> 00:11:35,208
is Tianbei's public security.

227
00:11:38,688 --> 00:11:41,009
If someone wants
to sabotage this cooperation,

228
00:11:41,448 --> 00:11:44,649
they'll start
with Tianbei's public security.

229
00:11:44,848 --> 00:11:46,088
Thank you for the heads-up.

230
00:11:46,369 --> 00:11:47,808
I'll keep a close eye on it.

231
00:11:49,848 --> 00:11:50,848
Then let me wish you

232
00:11:51,169 --> 00:11:53,009
great success, Secretary-General Tang.

233
00:12:04,129 --> 00:12:05,129
Mr. Tu,

234
00:12:05,369 --> 00:12:06,369
is there anything

235
00:12:06,769 --> 00:12:08,009
I can do for you?

236
00:12:08,009 --> 00:12:09,009
If it's convenient,

237
00:12:09,328 --> 00:12:10,649
tell my old friends

238
00:12:11,808 --> 00:12:12,808
that I'm back

239
00:12:13,568 --> 00:12:14,568
and that Prosperity

240
00:12:15,208 --> 00:12:16,208
is back.

241
00:12:34,279 --> 00:12:37,895
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

242
00:12:38,265 --> 00:12:42,250
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

243
00:12:47,006 --> 00:12:50,325
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

244
00:12:50,325 --> 00:12:55,410
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

245
00:12:58,999 --> 00:13:05,551
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

246
00:13:05,551 --> 00:13:13,972
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

247
00:13:13,972 --> 00:13:17,201
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

248
00:13:17,201 --> 00:13:20,396
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

249
00:13:20,396 --> 00:13:23,089
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

250
00:13:23,089 --> 00:13:27,706
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

251
00:13:31,617 --> 00:13:34,106
♪Burning alone♪

252
00:13:39,612 --> 00:13:45,981
♪The glory fades♪
